"Language of the menus you want to use with DVD/BluRay (comma separated, two "
"or three letter ISO-639 country code; you may use 'any' as a fallback)."
msgstr ""
"Teanga na roghchlár is mian leat a úsáid le DVD/BluRay (scartha le camóga, "
"cód tíre ISO-639 de dhá nó trí litir; is féidir leat 'any' a úsáid mar rogha "
"thánaisteach)."

