#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:212
msgid "Initial user scale factor for the interface, between 0.3 and 3.0"
msgstr ""
"Fachtóir scálaithe tosaigh an úsáideora don chomhéadan, idir 0.3 agus 3.0"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:215
msgid ""
"Show the errors of VLC at the bottom of the window, and ask before removing "
"media from a playlist or from the play queue, or deleting playlists. Off, "
"the errors are only kept in the messages of VLC and these removals are done "
"at once; deleting a file from the disk is always confirmed."
msgstr ""
"Taispeáin earráidí VLC ag bun na fuinneoige, agus fiafraigh sula mbaintear "
"meáin de sheinnliosta nó den scuaine sheinnte, nó sula scriostar seinnlistí. "
"Má tá sé múchta, ní choimeádtar na hearráidí ach i dteachtaireachtaí VLC "
"agus déantar na baintí seo láithreach; iarrtar deimhniú i gcónaí sula "
"scriostar comhad ón diosca."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:225
msgid "set the options for qml debugger"
msgstr "socraigh na roghanna don dífhabhtóir qml"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:226
msgid ""
"set the options for qml debugger (see http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qtquick-"
"debugging.html#starting-applications)"
msgstr ""
"socraigh na roghanna don dífhabhtóir qml (féach http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/"
"qtquick-debugging.html#starting-applications)"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:246
msgid ""
"Show the playback controls in fullscreen when the mouse moves. Off, only the "
"keyboard shows them (the I key). The skins read it for their fullscreen "
"controller too."
msgstr ""
"Taispeáin na rialtáin athsheinma sa lánscáileán nuair a bhogann an luch. Má "
"tá sé múchta, ní thaispeánann ach an méarchlár iad (an eochair I). Léann na "
"craicinn é dá rialaitheoir lánscáileáin freisin."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:262
msgid ""
"Display the cover art of the audio playing in the player (the cone in the "
"compact view). Off, a plain picture takes its place, which also prevents "
"burning the screen."
msgstr ""
"Taispeáin ealaín chlúdaigh na fuaime atá á seinm sa seinnteoir (an cón san "
"amharc dlúth). Má tá sé múchta, cuirtear pictiúr simplí ina háit, rud a "
"choisceann dó an scáileáin freisin."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:286
msgid ""
"This option allows the interface to be shown and raised automatically when a "
"video/audio playback starts, or never."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an rogha seo don chomhéadan a bheith taispeánta agus tugtha chun "
"tosaigh go huathoibríoch nuair a thosaíonn athsheinm físeáin/fuaime, nó "
"riamh."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:289
msgid "Enable window titlebar"
msgstr "Cumasaigh barra teidil na fuinneoige"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:290
msgid ""
"This option enables the title bar. Disabling it will remove the titlebar and "
"move window buttons within the interface (Client Side Decoration)"
msgstr ""
"Cumasaíonn an rogha seo an barra teidil. Má dhíchumasaítear é, bainfear an "
"barra teidil agus bogfar cnaipí na fuinneoige isteach sa chomhéadan (maisiú "
"ar thaobh an chliaint)"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:294
msgid "Show the menu bar"
msgstr "Taispeáin an barra roghchláir"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:295
msgid "This option displays the classic menu bar"
msgstr "Taispeánann an rogha seo an barra roghchláir clasaiceach"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:297
msgid "Pin video controls"
msgstr "Greamaigh rialtáin an fhíseáin"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:298
msgid "Place video controls above and below the video instead of above"
msgstr ""
"Cuir rialtáin an fhíseáin os cionn agus faoi bhun an fhíseáin in ionad os a "
"chionn amháin"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:301
msgid "Show the frame at the hovered position above the seek bar"
msgstr "Taispeáin an fráma ag an suíomh faoin luch os cionn an bharra léime"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:305
msgid "Select Qt video integration backend"
msgstr "Roghnaigh inneall cúil chomhtháthú físeáin Qt"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:306
msgid ""
"Select Qt video integration backend. Use with care, the interface may not "
"start if an incompatible compositor is selected"
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh inneall cúil chomhtháthú físeáin Qt. Úsáid go cúramach é; "
"b'fhéidir nach dtosóidh an comhéadan má roghnaítear comhshuiteoir neamh-"
"chomhoiriúnach"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:308
msgid "Use smooth scrolling in Flickable based views"
msgstr "Úsáid scrollú réidh in amhairc bunaithe ar Flickable"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:309
msgid ""
"Deactivating this option will disable smooth scrolling in Flickable based "
"views (such as the Play Queue). This option is only respected with a scroll "
"handler, see option `qt-use-scroll-handler`."
msgstr ""
"Má dhíghníomhachtaítear an rogha seo, díchumasófar scrollú réidh in amhairc "
"bunaithe ar Flickable (mar an Scuaine sheinnte). Ní urramaítear an rogha seo "
"ach le láimhseálaí scrollaithe; féach an rogha `qt-use-scroll-handler`."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:312
msgid "Use Kirigami scroll handler for Flickable based views"
msgstr "Úsáid láimhseálaí scrollaithe Kirigami d'amhairc bunaithe ar Flickable"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:313
msgid "Using Kirigami scroll handler may improve scrolling behavior."
msgstr ""
"D'fhéadfadh láimhseálaí scrollaithe Kirigami iompar an scrollaithe a "
"fheabhsú."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:315
msgid "Safe area for the user interface"
msgstr "Limistéar sábháilte don chomhéadan úsáideora"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:316
msgid ""
"Sets the safe area percentage between 0.0 and 100 when you want to ensure "
"the visibility of the user interface on a constrained viewport"
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn sé céatadán an limistéir shábháilte idir 0.0 agus 100 nuair is "
"mian leat a chinntiú go bhfuil an comhéadan úsáideora le feiceáil ar "
"limistéar amhairc teoranta"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:320
msgid "Print Qt's important internal messages"
msgstr "Priontáil teachtaireachtaí inmheánacha tábhachtacha Qt"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:321
msgid "Enable Qt's all own messaging categories except the debug category."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh catagóirí teachtaireachta uile Qt ach amháin an chatagóir "
"dífhabhtaithe."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:323
msgid "Hide the window on close"
msgstr "Folaigh an fhuinneog nuair a dhúntar í"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:324
msgid ""
"Instead of closing the application, hide the window. This setting is only "
"applicable when system tray icon is enabled."
msgstr ""
"In ionad an feidhmchlár a dhúnadh, folaigh an fhuinneog. Ní bhaineann an "
"socrú seo ach nuair atá deilbhín thráidire an chórais cumasaithe."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:326
msgid "Enable backdrop blur filter for the main window if possible"
msgstr "Cumasaigh scagaire doiléirithe cúlra don phríomhfhuinneog más féidir"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:327
msgid ""
"If backdrop blur filter is available, use translucency in the backgrounds of "
"certain parts of the user interface instead of a solid color. This setting "
"impairs readibility of text."
msgstr ""
"Má tá scagaire doiléirithe cúlra ar fáil, úsáid tréshoilseacht i gcúlraí "
"codanna áirithe den chomhéadan úsáideora in ionad datha sholadaigh. "
"Laghdaíonn an socrú seo inléiteacht an téacs."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:330
msgid "Enable picture-in-picture (PiP) mode"
msgstr "Cumasaigh an mód pictiúr i bpictiúr (PiP)"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:331
msgid ""
"Picture-in-picture mode allows playing video contained in a smaller area so "
"that the interface remains usable."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an mód pictiúr i bpictiúr duit físeán a sheinm i limistéar níos lú "
"ionas gur féidir an comhéadan a úsáid fós."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:334
msgid ""
"Adjusts the accent color, special values are 'default' and 'system' "
"(requires Qt 6.6) ."
msgstr ""
"Coigeartaíonn sé an dath béime; is iad 'default' agus 'system' na luachanna "
"speisialta (teastaíonn Qt 6.6) ."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:435
msgid "Check for VLC Redesign updates"
msgstr "Seiceáil le haghaidh nuashonruithe VLC Redesign"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:436
msgid ""
"Look for a new release of VLC Redesign on GitHub at startup, at most once a "
"day."
msgstr ""
"Lorg eisiúint nua de VLC Redesign ar GitHub ag an tosú, uair sa lá ar a "
"mhéad."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:440
msgid "Resume at"
msgstr "Lean ar aghaidh ag"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:441
msgid ""
"Seconds into the media of the command line where playback continues, after "
"an update."
msgstr ""
"An líon soicindí isteach i meán na líne ordaithe óna leanann an athsheinm ar "
"aghaidh, tar éis nuashonraithe."

